## Audit / freeze note

This archive is frozen at render time. Its client-side search and year navigation operate over fixed embedded content and fetch nothing. The **editable template** reads the pinned local token mirror; the **sealed HTML** inlines the token CSS and applies the declared font-sealing mode, reading no sibling stylesheet, no font sidecar, and no live upstream URL.

To re-render against newer upstream tokens or a longer span, re-sync the mirror, record a new commit SHA, and regenerate — **reusing the participant → role mapping above**. The previous archive remains valid for audit at its recorded SHA. Regeneration produces a new artifact; supersession is history, not deletion.
